s/2015/15-274_d18e.pdf","page_label":"file page 73, lines 26-16"}]},{"heading":"How the case got here","paragraphs":["The Supreme Court heard oral argument in this case on March 2, 2016."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 3, lines 8-18","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2015/15-274_d18e.pdf","page_label":"file page 3, lines 8-18"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 65, lines 16-30","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2015/15-274_d18e.pdf","page_label":"file page 65, lines 16-30"}]},{"heading":"What each side wants","paragraphs":["the sides that brought the case want the Court to invalidate the Texas clinic rules.","the opposing sides want the Court to keep the Texas clinic rules in force."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 24, lines 18-46","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2015/15-274_d18e.pdf","page_label":"file page 24, lines 18-46"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 3, lines 20-34","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2015/15-274_d18e.pdf","page_label":"file page 3, lines 20-34"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 36, lines 24-24","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2015/15-274_d18e.pdf","page_label":"file page 36, lines 24-24"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 56, lines 6-12","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2015/15-274_d18e.pdf","page_label":"file page 56, lines 6-12"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 73, lines 26-16